{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"d"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"][0]. Let's conside some state ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":") and search through all "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" from 0 to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" students will go to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"th room, than a probability of such event consists of factors: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"superscript"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" --- which students will go to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"th room."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":"(1 / "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":")"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"superscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· (("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - 1) / "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":")"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text