["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mx"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]. Do not forget to update maximum queue value and get the accepted."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/28/problem/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Do not fear, DravDe is kind"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"strong"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Solution by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/RAD"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RAD"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Let's split all trucks into different classes by the sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":". Answer sequence consists of trucks from only one class, so let's solve problem for different classes independently."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Let's loop through trucks from fixed class in the order, then follow in the motorcade and update values in dynamics "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] - maximum profit we can get, if last truck has "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Truck with number i can update two values:"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" it can update value "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"] with value "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"] + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"v"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":". It means this truck continued some motorcade, started from some previous truck."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" if "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0 it can update value "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"] with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"v"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":". It means this truck started motorcade. Answer will be in "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"[0]"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" To restore the trucks included in the answer, we can keep with the maximal sum in z the index of last truck that updated this sum. Also we store the ancestor p for each truck that updated something in z. This ancestor is calculated when we consider i-th truck and doesn't change further: p[i] = -1 if truck i became beginning of the motorcade, otherwise p[i] = last truck that updated "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"]. We start restore of the answer from last truck updated z[0]. After that we restore everything using only p. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/28/problem/E"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"DravDe saves the world"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"strong"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Solution by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/Gerald"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Gerald"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Problem by "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/profile/RAD"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RAD"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" Let's look at geometrical locus where DravDe can land. It can be eigher an angle or a line(half-line)."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" 1. Locus is an angle if and only if projection of vector "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"v"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and vector "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"u"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" on Oxy plane is not collinear. This angle is easy to calculate. Angular vertex is DravDe starting point and one of half-lines is collinear with place speed vector projection. Second half-line is easy to calculate:"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tv"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tu"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 0"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tv"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tu"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"x"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tv"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"U"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":"· "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"tu"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"y"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" where A - starting point, B - landing point. Consider tv equal to 1 and calculate tu from first equation. From second and third calculate point B. This point lies on the second half-line of the angle."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" 2. If plane speed projection and wind speed projection is collinear, locus is half-line or line, depending on the difference between this two speeds."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" If the answer exist, than polygon and locus have at least onecommon point. And t1 and t2 is minimal on edge points. So now let's cross all segments with locus, calculate t1 and t2 for each intersection point and select minimal answer. Thank you for your participation. Good luck with upsolving and incoming contests. Luck - is very useful and it is good to have it."},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" With best regards, Ivan."},{"kind":"line_break"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"document"},"schema":2,"sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/blog/entry/685"}